diff --git a/Docs/RetroPixels.txt b/Docs/RetroPixels.txt
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..4aef793
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Docs/RetroPixels.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,29 @@
+Supermodel for RetroPixels
+==========================
+
+This is a MODIFIED VERSION of Supermodel (https://github.com/trzy/Supermodel),
+based on commit 24d2ffc (2026-07-26), changed for RetroPixels on 2026-10-21.
+Like Supermodel it is free software under the GNU General Public License,
+version 3 or (at your option) any later version; see LICENSE.txt / COPYING.
+
+What was changed (every change is marked "RetroPixels" in the source):
+
+- Src/OSD/RetroPixels.h, Src/OSD/RetroPixels.cpp (new): the player's own
+  folder and the game recorder.
+- Src/OSD/FileSystemPath.h and Src/OSD/{Windows,Unix,OSX}/FileSystemPath.cpp:
+  when the SUPERMODEL_HOME environment variable names a folder, Supermodel.ini,
+  NVRAM, save states, the log and screenshots go there (Config/, NVRAM/,
+  Saves/, Log/, Screenshots/). Games.xml and Music.xml are read from the
+  usual Config folder (the new "Data" path type) and Assets/ from the usual
+  place. Without SUPERMODEL_HOME nothing changes.
+- Src/OSD/SDL/Main.cpp:
+  - the window follows its size when another program resizes it (RetroPixels
+    docks the game into its own window): after the size has been the same for
+    3 frames the renderers are set up again for it, as when switching to full
+    screen;
+  - -desktop-res: full screen at the desktop's own resolution;
+  - -rp-record=<dir> and -rp-ffmpeg=<ffmpeg>: record the game (see
+    RetroPixels.h), paused while the emulator is paused;
+  - the help text and the log name the RetroPixels changes.
+- Src/OSD/SDL/Audio.cpp: each frame's sound also goes to the recorder.
+- Makefiles/Rules.inc: builds Src/OSD/RetroPixels.cpp.
